      "dc:source": "crimes-amendment-bail-and-sentencing-act-2006.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(4) Without limiting the matters that the constable may take into\naccount in considering, for the purposes of paragraph (3)(e), the\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nintrusiveness of the forensic procedure, the constable must (where\nappropriate) take into account the religious beliefs of the suspect.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n(4) Without limiting the matters that the constable may take into\naccount in considering, for the purposes of paragraph (3)(e), the\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nintrusiveness of the forensic procedure, the constable must (where\nappropriate) take into account the religious beliefs of the suspect.",
      "cml:asserts": [
